      <version name="1.0.0" author="A-intheCode" time="2026-10-03T14:12:21Z">
        <changelog><![CDATA[
+ v1.0.0: Initial public release
- Full SMuFL glyph font rendering (Bravura)
- Standard-compliant automatic beaming & rhythm division
- Dynamics CC automation (CC1, CC11, CC7) & bow swell generator
- Articulations drawer with Reaticulate sync
- MusicXML 4.0 import and export
        ]]></changelog>
